    "description": "Operations tagged Logout across 2 of this provider's published API definitions: login-gov-oidc-openapi.yml, login-gov-saml-openapi.yml. Each path carries the servers of the definition it was published in.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Login.gov Partner Support\n Email: partners@login.gov",
